    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋinakoloŋit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kicik Ŋisirael daadaŋ, tolimok ikes ebe, ‘Emaikina iyes yaut neni kaŋ anapaki a ŋina etubunitoe ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ŋuna a ŋamugati aŋuna ebob eure kec aneni kaŋ.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok ikes atemar erae nu ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo, ŋuna emaikina iyes inakis neni a Ekapolon: Ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋiarei ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei, ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit ikwapei ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋinakoloŋit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inak ikale ipei taparacu, ido inak ŋinice eboŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina inakinae ŋinikale kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ŋina erae akilo apei ŋina a ŋakirya iguritoe a akimyet a ŋina ajokan a ŋina erae elita epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ŋun ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ŋuna emaikina inanakinetei a ŋinakoloŋit, ŋuna epeyo ŋuna ebob eure kec aneni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten, emaikina inakinae aŋuna a ŋinikale elita epei ŋolo ke epiini; emaikina tobukokinae aŋuna ke Ekapolon ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten nakibois ŋina asegan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyoŋ inak ikale ŋinice eboŋ kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ta ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten lopite ŋolo etiyaere aŋuna ka ainakinet a ŋina ka ataparacu. Emaikina inak iŋes erae ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon ka ŋina elakara Ekapolon aŋuna keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta aŋuna a Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato emaikina iyoŋ yau ŋikaalei ŋiarei ŋulumesekin ŋulu erae apolou ekaru epei, ŋulu emam neni eŋwali, yau ŋul kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ŋakiloi ŋaarei ŋuna a ŋakirya a ŋuna ajokak a ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet ta ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ŋin ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina a ŋinakoloŋit a Sabato ŋina emaikina yaunae kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina epeyo a ŋinakoloŋit ta ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋololap.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa ke elap epei a ŋololap, emaikina iyes yaut ŋainakineta nu ŋuna epeyo neni ke Ekapolon: Ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋiarei, emesek, ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋikanikaarei ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei, ido tomam neni eŋwalilt ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka daŋ aŋuna a ŋolomoŋ, emaikina yaunae ŋakiloi ŋauni ŋuna a ŋakirya ŋuna ajokak a ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ka aŋuna a emesek, emaikina yaunae ŋakiloi ŋaarei ŋuna a ŋakirya a ŋuna ajokak a ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka aŋuna a ŋinikalemesek, emaikina yaunae akilo apei ŋina a ŋakirya a ŋuna ajokak a ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet. Erae ŋin ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta kec ŋuna a ŋimaten erae ŋilitae ŋiarei ŋulu ke epiini aŋuna a ŋolomoŋ, elita epei aŋuna emesek ka elita epei aŋuna a ŋinikalemesek. Erae ŋun ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋololap, alolapyo a daadaŋ a ŋulu ke ekaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi emaikina yaunae ekoroe epei erae ainakinet neni ke Ekapolon aŋuna ka asecit a ŋina emaikina yaunae kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina epeyo a ŋinakoloŋit ta ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta a apaki a ŋina a Paska",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon elap ŋolo ke epei, emaikina yaunae ŋainakineta ŋuna a Paska. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋikan elap ŋol, emaikina kitiyata ŋasuban; emaikina ŋituŋa kimuja ŋamugati ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, emaikina ŋituŋa tocunakinos iwapei kilipa, nyilot loticisyo kus akitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina yaunae neni ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo: Ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋiarei, emesek ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋikanikaarei ŋulu erae apolou ke ekaru epei ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakinet kec ŋina a ŋikinyom emaikina erae ŋakirya ŋuna ajokak ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet; aŋuna a ŋolomoŋ, emaikina yaunae ŋakiloi ŋauni ŋuna a ŋakirya aŋuna a emesek, emaikina yaunae ŋakiloi ŋaarei ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka aŋuna a ŋinikale a ŋulukanikaarei emaikina yaunae akilo apei ŋina a ŋakirya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina daŋ yaunae ekoroe epei ikwapei ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit aŋuna ka amookunia iyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes yaut ŋainakineta ŋun kaapei ka ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo a ŋina taparacu, ŋun erae ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋinakoloŋit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alopite a ŋolopei a ŋol emaikina iyes yaut a ŋinakoloŋit alotooma ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei, akimuj ŋina epeyo ŋina erae ainakinet ŋina ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon, einakinio iŋes kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina a ŋinakoloŋit ta ainakinet ŋina a ŋimaten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi akoloŋit ŋina a ŋakanikaarei emaikina iyes tocunakinos iwapei kilipa, nyiloto loticisyo kus kitiyata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋasuban a ŋisabito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
